.*
.* The CL kit's panel group for UIAPI.clle: a header record, a list of
.* objects with option 5, and a pop-up to position the list.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NUMCL BASETYPE='BIN 31'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OWNER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=COUNT CLASS=NUMCL.
:VARRCD NAME=HDR VARS='OWNER COUNT'.
:VARRCD NAME=ROW VARS='OPT OBJ TYPE'.
:LISTDEF NAME=OBJS VARS='OPT OBJ TYPE'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=LIST KEYL=KEYS HELP=LIST ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Kit Objects
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAI VAR=OWNER USAGE=OUTPUT.Owner
:DATAI VAR=COUNT USAGE=OUTPUT.Objects
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJS HELP=OPTS.No objects are listed.
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5' HELP=OPTS.5=Display
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=LIST.Work with Kit Objects
:P.The objects the kit's program listed.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=OPTS.Options
:P.Option 5 shows an object.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYS.Function keys
:P.F3 leaves, F5 shows the list again, F12 goes back.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
